<title>USA: Med-Design mulling strategic alternatives.</title>
<headline>Med-Design mulling strategic alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Med-Design Corp said Wednesday it had retained the investment banking services of Chase Manhattan Corp's Chase Securities Inc to help it examine a broad range of strategic alternatives.</p>
<p>It did not elaborate beyond saying it wanted to enhance shareholder value.</p>
<p>The company also said it had decided to consolidate its East Coast offices with its California location by relocating its Philadelphia corporate offices to Ventura, Calif., in the near future.</p>
</text>
